[[Sir Lancelot]] left a [[Ghost Trap]] with the image of Guinevere in the [[Mausoleum of Sir Lancelot]] to guard the entrance to his treasure chamber. {{Source|Memory Lane}} 

Many years later, [[Lok Lambert]] and [[Dante Vale]] attempted to enter Lancelot's hidden sanctuary. Dante discovered that by kissing the ghostly version of Guinevere's hand, in honor of Lancelot's quest, he was allowed to pass through to the treasure chamber. {{source|Memory Lane}}
